      "widgets_values": [
        "REFPACKS 1.0.0 \u2014 Flux 2 experimental test demo (not official model support). Select local model, encoder, VAE and image. Save refuses collisions by default; enable overwrite on reruns, or replace preparation+save with Load RefPack to reuse a cached file. LTXV: first-image/prefix guidance only, not H3-style identity/outfit conditioning. Flux 2: chain additional compatible packs via Add RefPack for multiple reference images.\n\nUse a compatible Flux 2 checkpoint, text encoder and VAE. The native Flux2Scheduler is used. Guidance 4 is intended for a guidance-distilled Flux 2 Dev configuration; adjust steps/guidance to your checkpoint."
      ]
